A||||17||MinnGreenGT||CarFax Theft- bastards!||||8||
Z||000000||MinnGreenGT||09-19-2001||08:00 PM||||OK, I have a 2-month use CarFax account.  I have voluntarily checked cars for anyone who has posted requests in the last couple of weeks.<P>Sadly, someone today decided to take advantage of my generosity and run a tremendous number of CarFax reports.<P>For those that don't know/understand- whenever you run a carfax report, it is emailed to my address... <P>Whoever is doing this, please stop now!  If you were intelligent enough to ask, I would gladly have run reports for you.  But now you have forced me into a PISSY mood- and I now have to be on guard about who I help.<P>I have always provided everyone here with whatever info I can- even regarding my "Special Projects" (Taillights & Gauges).  My goal in participating in this Forum is the have a friendly community with those of similiar interests- not to make a profit off you or to steal from you.  Although I have an unlimited use for this two month period, I do still consider it stealing. <P>To whoever is doing this. Please stop. For those that participate in this Forum- I'm sad to say that you should be weary of helping too many people... someone will eventually take advantage of your generosity-as someone has mine!<P>Joe- you did warn me... guess next time I'll be more secretive!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/halfpole.gif">  <BR>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||8
Z||000001||BlackDragon||09-19-2001||08:13 PM||||sorry to hear about that. what exactly is a carfax?<P>------------------<BR>We are all different for a reason<P><BR>BlackDragon||||reg||1
